# License / 许可与声明

> ## 本项目是什么 / What this project is
>
> **Create Aeronautics — 第三方移植版（Forge 1.20.1）**
> 本仓库是 **Create: Aeronautics** 及其配套子项目（SubLevel / Sable / Simulated / Offroad 等）
> 从**原版 NeoForge 1.21.1** **移植到 Forge 1.20.1** 的**非官方、第三方移植版**。
> 它**不属于**原开发团队，未获官方授权。
>
> **Create Aeronautics — Third-Party Port (Forge 1.20.1)**
> This repository is an **unofficial, third-party port** of **Create: Aeronautics** (and its sub-projects
> SubLevel / Sable / Simulated / Offroad) **ported from the original NeoForge 1.21.1 to Forge 1.20.1**.
> It is **not** part of the original development team and is **not officially authorized**.

---

## ⚠️ 重要声明 / Important Notice

- **本仓库为代码存档与学习用途，未获得原模组官方授权。**
  **This repository is for code archival and learning only; it is NOT officially authorized by the original mod authors.**
- **本仓库不包含任何美术资源**（贴图 / 模型 / 音频 / 字体 / 图标等）。相关资源版权归原模组作者所有（All Rights Reserved）。
  **This repository does NOT include any art assets** (textures / models / audio / fonts / icons). Those assets remain **All Rights Reserved** by the original authors.
- **代码许可沿用原模组的 MIT 许可（见第一节）；移植改动部分的版权归移植者所有，并独立于原模组官方版权。**
  **Code follows the original mod's MIT License (Section 1); the porting changes are copyrighted by the porter and are independent of the original mod's copyright.**
- **下方第三节所列第三方库独立于官方，版权归各自作者，与本移植版分开计。**
  **The third-party libraries in Section 3 are separate from the official mod, copyrighted by their respective authors.**

