## 四、移植版稳定性免责声明 / Port Stability Disclaimer

> ⚠️ **本移植版可能不如原版稳定。**
> 本移植版是社区个人从 NeoForge 1.21.1 手动移植到 Forge 1.20.1 的产物，**未经原开发团队测试与审核**，
> 可能含有**原版中不存在的 bug、崩溃、卡顿或存档损坏风险**。
> 使用本移植版**风险自担**：请务必定期备份你的游戏存档与世界文件；因使用本移植版导致的任何
> 存档丢失、数据损坏或设备损坏，移植者与原模组作者均**不承担责任**。
>
> ⚠️ **This port may be LESS STABLE than the original.**
> This port was manually ported by an individual community member from NeoForge 1.21.1 to Forge 1.20.1 and is
> **NOT tested or reviewed by the original developers**. It may contain **bugs, crashes, performance issues, or
> world-corruption risks that do NOT exist in the original**.
> Use this port **at your own risk**: always back up your save files and worlds. The porter and the original
> authors are **NOT responsible** for any save loss, data corruption, or device damage caused by using this port.

